description	"Imperial Storm Commando

^9Weapons:
- Melee
^2-- Lightweight
^2-- RoF: 1.10x
- Venomous Vibroknife ^9(Purple Saber)
^1-- Defense: No
^1-- Damage: Low (100)
^1-- Length: 16
^2-- Lightweight
^2-- Hit: Slows/Poisons

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (1) ^3[CS4 Melee]

^8Attributes:
^2- Hacking: 1.15x
^2- Skill Recharge: 1.1x
- Reinforcements (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Blast Armor
- Sense Immunity
- Tracking Receiver
- Grapple Hop
- Slow Faller
- Anti MT (1)
- Bunny Hop (1)

Highly elite covert operatives."
